      "page_number": 1,
      "page_count": 1,
      "visible_lines": [
        "Declare War Mode",
        "To start a battle with a fleet or town",
        "on screen, open Info and press L or",
        "press Y twice. Choose a target to begin.",
        "Your faction is now at war with theirs,",
        "and Friendship drops sharply.",
        "Declaring war on a town limits what you",
        "can do there. You cannot use this command",
        "against an allied fleet."
      ],
